---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="privacy-hero">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: September 2025</p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-content">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Code Like It's 198x ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy.
        This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use our website
        and educational resources.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Don't Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We believe in minimal data collection. Our website is designed to work without
        requiring personal information:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>No user accounts or registration required</li>
        <li>No tracking cookies</li>
        <li>No analytics or third-party trackers</li>
        <li>No personal data collection</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>GitHub and External Services</h2>
      <p>
        When you interact with our project through GitHub (for issues, pull requests, or
        discussions), you are subject to GitHub's privacy policy. We only see information
        that GitHub makes publicly available or that you choose to share with us.
      </p>

      <h2>Discord Community</h2>
      <p>
        If you join our Discord community, you are subject to Discord's privacy policy.
        We do not have access to your Discord account information beyond what you share
        in public channels.
      </p>

      <h2>Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may use browser local storage to remember your preferences (such as
        theme selection). This data is stored only in your browser and is never transmitted
        to our servers.
      </p>

      <h2>Open Source</h2>
      <p>
        This project is open source. All code is publicly available on GitHub, ensuring
        transparency in how the website operates.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any
        changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated"
        date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please open an issue on our
        <a href="https://github.com/code198x/code198x/issues" target="_blank">GitHub repository</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .privacy-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .privacy-content {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .privacy-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .privacy-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-content ul {
    margin-left: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-content a {
    color: var(--link-color, #667eea);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .privacy-content a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>